WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Turn on Records-to-Demand. Catena runs your records-and-bills operation.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
Catena maintains what is needed, makes authorized requests, and checks what comes back.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
It works through missing information, follow-up and corrections.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.000
Catena evaluates the file against your firm’s readiness criteria. When it says ready, it shows why.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
If new evidence changes the answer, Catena reopens the readiness decision.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Your firm keeps policy and professional judgment—and drafts the demand.
